+/// Surfaces the `[wiki] seed_context` read-side switch. Silent when reads are
+/// allowed (the default); one line when they are refused, or when the setting
+/// cannot be parsed, so the owner can see why `ta_wiki_*` reads fail.
+fn check_wiki_reads(project_root: &Path) -> Option<CheckResult> {
